Dear Oliver,

Thank you for being a New York Times subscriber. We're writing to let you know about an upcoming change to your subscription rate.

Starting with your first bill on or after November 15, 2026, your subscription rate will change from $17.00 per month to $25.00 per month, plus applicable sales tax.

This rate supports the independent journalism of more than 1,800 journalists around the world. You don't need to do anything to keep your subscription.

If you have questions, visit our Help Center.

Sincerely,
The New York Times

The New York Times Company, 620 Eighth Avenue, New York, NY 10018
